'''Youcan''' (大夢くん, ''Ōmu-kun'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Two Can]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

