==Trivia==
*Youcan strongly resembles [[wikia:ultra:Alien Guts|Alien Guts]] from ''[[wikipedia:Ultraman|Ultraman]]'', though with the proportions of an actual bird and a larger beak in exchange for reduced brain volume.
*As an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] enemy whose Japanese description says he left the heavenly world, Youcan may have been inspired by [[wikipedia:Chazaqiel|Chazaqiel]] or [[wikipedia:Kokabiel|Kokabiel]], fallen angels from the [[wikipedia:Book of Enoch|Book of Enoch]] whose names can be taken as "God's Shooting Star" and "God's Star", respectively. Kokabiel in particular is known as the "angel of the stars" and teaches astrology and constellations.
*His name is a play on the word ''toucan'' and the phrase "you can". This is further supported by his description saying that he is over-confident, most likely from others saying "you can!"
*His Japanese name, Ōmu-kun (大夢くん), contains the kanji for "great" or "large" (大) and "dream" (夢), literally meaning "big dream". This is a pun on the Japanese word for cockatoo (鸚鵡), which is also pronounced ''ōmu''.
*In the Korean version of [[The Battle Cats]], his name is Daemong-i (대몽이), which means having big hopes and dreams.
*His English description has a typo. It says, "A extra-confident bird," instead of "''An'' extra-confident bird".
*He is tied with [[UltraBaaBaa]] for the highest [[Barrier]] HP, with 266,000.
**Both Youcan and UltraBaaBaa are also spammed in stages with "Genome" in their name: UltraBaaBaa in [[Haunted Genome]], Youcan in [[Banana Genomes]].
*He is the first [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy out of  [[Johnnyleon|two]] to have a secondary trait other than [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and the only non-event Angel enemy to have a secondary trait at all.

